<hi rendition="#aq"><persName ref="http://d-nb.info/gnd/100963803">Victor</persName>is Vitensis et <persName ref="http://d-nb.info/gnd/118968319">Vigili</persName>i Tapsensis, provinciae Bizacenae episcoporum<lb/>
