in <hi rendition="#aq">Sir <persName ref="http://d-nb.info/gnd/117612006">W. <hi rendition="#g">Jardine</hi></persName>'s Naturalist's Library (Horses by <persName ref="http://d-nb.info/gnd/100560792">Ch. Hamilton Smith</persName>.<lb/>
