von 1844-48 <persName ref="http://d-nb.info/gnd/104356480">Wilh. Karl Hartw. <hi rendition="#g">Peters</hi></persName> (geb. 1815, <persName ref="http://d-nb.info/gnd/100190014">Lichten&#x017F;tein</persName>'s<lb/>
