<hi rendition="#g">Beneden</hi></persName>, <persName ref="http://d-nb.info/gnd/102461627">F. <hi rendition="#g">Dujardin</hi></persName> und <persName ref="http://d-nb.info/gnd/116317639">Arm. <hi rendition="#g">de Quatrefages</hi></persName> hatten<lb/>
